{"message":"The source states the reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec 31, 2005. I interpret the requested change as 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve, in millions of U.S. dollars: 10 - 4.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"v2006 - v2005","variables":{"v2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"v2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"v2006":"source:q11n3","v2005":"source:q11n4"}}}